abstract: >-
  A tested Python reference engine, native libobs plugin, and obspython bridge for
  a telemetry-driven broadcast console. The repository includes deterministic
  figures, a versioned live OBS evidence bundle, fail-closed telemetry contracts,
  and a research-grade technical design manuscript.
